[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3726.069, "timestamp": "01:02:06", "text": "伙计。 我想把她送走以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3735.43, "timestamp": "01:02:15", "text": "但我给了她这个。 嗯，是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3738.95, "timestamp": "01:02:18", "text": "，我也得提升一下这方面的水平了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3749.19, "timestamp": "01:02:29", "text": "是的，我得到了奈芙夫人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3752.789, "timestamp": "01:02:32", "text": "我跟西博的缘分一直不太好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3756.15, "timestamp": "01:02:36", "text": "我目前只得到了两个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3758.47, "timestamp": "01:02:38", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3763.349, "timestamp": "01:02:43", "text": "我买了10个。好的。  10分里我只得了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3767.593, "timestamp": "01:02:47", "text": "2分。 我当时真是太倒霉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3775.27, "timestamp": "01:02:55", "text": "另外，我当时在想 C6，我的意思是，呃，"}]